{"type":"standard","title":"Nunukan Tidung","displaytitle":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Nunukan Tidung</span></span>","namespace":{"id":0,"text":""},"wikibase_item":"Q63214959","titles":{"canonical":"Nunukan_Tidung","normalized":"Nunukan Tidung","display":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Nunukan Tidung</span></span>"},"pageid":34839260,"lang":"en","dir":"ltr","revision":"1256655005","tid":"5118f601-9fbd-11ef-87f7-e4785d8facba","timestamp":"2024-11-10T23:41:33Z","description":"Sabahan language of Kalimantan (Indonesian Borneo)","description_source":"local","content_urls":{"desktop":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nunukan_Tidung","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nunukan_Tidung?action=history","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nunukan_Tidung?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Nunukan_Tidung"},"mobile":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nunukan_Tidung","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special:History/Nunukan_Tidung","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nunukan_Tidung?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Nunukan_Tidung"}},"extract":"Nunukan Tidong or Southern Tidung, is one of several Sabahan languages of Kalimantan, Indonesia, spoken by the Tidong people. It has lost the system of Austronesian alignment retained by Northern Tidung in Sabah, Malaysia.","extract_html":"<p><b>Nunukan Tidong</b> or <b>Southern Tidung</b>, is one of several Sabahan languages of Kalimantan, Indonesia, spoken by the Tidong people. It has lost the system of Austronesian alignment retained by Northern Tidung in Sabah, Malaysia.</p>"}